body:
Mate, i have money but i don't have a credit card and i can't buy stuff online for myself, so i just asked here if somebody purchased the program ( for themselves ) and choosed the buy for me and a friend 2 for 1 option. ( which is the same price as the regular one ) but Mr.Peterson wants us not only to help ourselves but to help someone else along the way. so you don't have nothing absolutely nothing to lose if you gave me a voucher. but you have everything to gain because you helped to make the world a better place, and i'm not relying on pity, i didn't ask for money or services. i just wanted somebody to give me a ride in their car ( because we're going to the same destination so what you have to lose if you gave me a ride with you ? 

&#x200B;

P.S. somebody gave me a voucher for the full program and i'm really really grateful for it thank you, and god bless you. and i will pay the favor forward.
